    "last_verified": "2026-10-02",
    "source": "Official FundedNext pages only: https://fundednext.com/ (pricing section, plan data embedded in page), https://fundednext.com/company, https://fundednext.com/trading-platforms, https://fundednext.com/partners, help.fundednext.com articles 8019803 (min trading days), 8020768 (reward share), 8030880 / 8021073 / 9094074 (no time limit), helpfutures.fundednext.com articles 15053874 (futures prices), 14282252 (Legacy pass rules), 14878840 / 14878851 (Flex target and consistency).",
    "pricing": "promo = current discounted price, standard = crossed-out list price. Forex: only the smallest size of each model shows a discount (code STOCT); other sizes show a single price, recorded as standard. The site also runs site-wide offers that may lower checkout prices further - re-verify before publishing. Futures: Flex promo price applies to a customer's first two purchases (thereafter $79.99 / $149.99 / $289.99 per help centre); Rapid promo code RAPID; Flex code FNFLEX. Flex standard = regular price from the help centre ($79.99/$149.99/$289.99), not the higher crossed-out price shown on the pricing page.",
    "billing": "All FundedNext CFD and futures challenges are a one-time fee. The site states 'One-time fee. No subscription.' and the futures help centre describes them as one-time account setup fees. No activation fee is stated. Resets are paid separately (futures reset fees: Flex $77.99/$147.99/$278.99, Legacy $73.99/$183.99/$220.79, Rapid Pro $84.99/$174.99/$299.99, Rapid Daily $89.99/$189.99/$299.99).",
    "rule_units": "Forex rules are % of account size. Futures rules are fixed USD amounts.",
    "null_means": "Field not stated on the firm's official pricing page or help centre. Check the firm's rules pages before publishing.",
    "forex_rules": "Stellar models use static drawdown. Stellar 2-Step and Lite base reward share is 80% on the standard 21-day cycle; 90% on the On-Demand option and 95% with the paid 'Lifetime Reward 95%' add-on. A 40% consistency rule applies only to the On-Demand reward option. Stellar 2-Step also pays a one-time 15% Performance Reward from challenge-phase profit. Stellar 1-Step reward share is shown as 'Up to 95%' on the pricing page (help centre: 80% base, 90% with Scale-Up, 95% with add-ons). Fee refund: 2-Step with 1st reward, 1-Step and Lite at 3rd reward, Instant none. Stellar Instant has no daily loss limit and a 6% trailing max loss. Max risk 3% per position at any time on all Stellar models.",
    "futures_rules": "No daily loss limit on Flex, Legacy and Rapid Pro (daily_loss null = none). Max loss is end-of-day (EOD). max_contracts = mini contracts allowed during the challenge (micros = 10x); Legacy funded accounts allow more (3/5/7 minis). payout_cap = 'Maximum Withdrawal' per reward on the funded account. Consistency: Flex and Legacy 40% during the challenge only; Rapid Pro 40% on the funded account only; Rapid Daily none. Minimum trading days are not stated as a number (help centre says there are no benchmark-day requirements during the challenge; 5 benchmark days are needed for Flex and Legacy rewards).",
    "not_listed": "FundedNext Labs 'FNL:001 NO DLL 1-Step' ($50K CFD experimental account) and the Free Trial are not included. Bolt and the original Rapid challenge were discontinued in 2026."
  },
